scenario.en:
:root { --color-blue-600: #0052CC; --color-interactive: var(--color-blue-600); }
[data-theme="dark"] { --color-blue-600: #4D8AFF; }
.button { background: var(--color-interactive); }

The button markup is <button class="button">Save</button> — it never mentions a theme or a hex.

